# ===== 仓库边界：根目录下只跟踪这三个目录 =====
/*
!/PRD/
!/Frontend/
!/Backend/
!.gitignore

# ===== Frontend（Vue）=====
Frontend/node_modules/
Frontend/dist/

# ===== Backend（Python / FastAPI）=====
Backend/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ===== MODFLOW 运行产物 =====
# 后端跑模型时生成的工作目录（输入文件、.hds、.lst 等）不入库
Backend/**/runs/
